Package: ggBoostedTrees
Type: Package
Title: Visually Exploring Boosted Tree Models
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-09-03
Authors@R: person("John", "Ehrlinger",
  role = c("aut", "cre"),
  email = "john.ehrlinger@gmail.com",
  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5340-5154"))
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
URL: https://github.com/ehrlinger/ggBoostedTrees
BugReports: https://github.com/ehrlinger/ggBoostedTrees/issues
Description: Graphic elements for exploring boosted tree models fit with
    'boostmtree' and 'BoostMLR', which implement Friedman's gradient descent
    boosting with multivariate tree base learners for longitudinal responses.
    Separates data extraction from rendering so that additional boosting
    backends can be added without changes to the plotting layer.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
